     § 06 · DESIGN DECISION 03
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section">
  <span class="decision-mono">Design Decision 03</span>
  <h2 class="cs-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px; max-width: none;">A living artifact, shaped by the team.</h2>
  <p class="body-text" style="max-width: none;">The insight view isn't a fixed report. Add widgets, ask AI scoped to any widget, reorder or remove what's not relevant. Share it as a live source of truth — it updates as new evidence arrives.</p>

